  <tei:standOff type="notes">
    <tei:note type="commentary" target="#note_1" xml:lang="en">
      <tei:p>The Kiddush recited on Shabbos morning was instituted rabbinically. It is considered less important than the Friday night Kiddush which is of Scriptural origin. It is euphemistically called the Great Kiddush.</tei:p>
